# Burning Sun Cavalry: the same ability when it blocks (CR 509.1). Bot2's Grizzly Bears (2/2) attack on turn 4. Bot1 controls an Orazca
# Raptor, so the blocking Cavalry becomes a 3/3: it kills the Bears and survives their 2 damage (CR 704.5g); as a plain 2/2 it would die.

